### 1. Create an account
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "initialDeposit": 1000
}

### 2. Get all accounts
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-0000000001",
  "toAccount": "ACC-0000000002",
  "amount": 100,
  "remark": "Test transfer"
}